><formatted-text><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="11">What this tells us (all customers)
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">Retention carries profit: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">recurring customers are 53% of buyers but earn 76% of gross profit.
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">Second orders are slow: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">the median gap is 254 days; 54% return within 2 years. Silence is not churn.
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">The funnel is empty: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">no sign-ups since 25 Sep 2024, and 80 registered customers never ordered.
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">Action: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">a second-order nudge for one-time buyers and a first-order offer for the 80.
